  "decision": "Independently maintain $5K at 58% and $10K at 27%. The October 23 Ethereum Foundation notice postpones the planned October 26 Glamsterdam Hoodi activation while EIP-8037 interactions with mainnet smart contracts are investigated. This is a real execution delay with no replacement date, so protocol scores move from 0.82 to 0.76 for $5K and from 0.66 to 0.62 for $10K; statuses remain green/yellow and rounded weighted signals become 53/38. The delay is prudent testnet containment, not a mainnet failure or rollback. The latest stored market fallback is $2,400.52 (-1.60% over 24 hours), still below the lost $2.7K base. October 22 ETF data remains unconfirmed, the bond rally eases one liquidity pressure, and Brent above $113 sustains inflation risk. Preserve October 8 updatedAt, probability histories and all What Changed entries because no catalyst color or target probability changes are warranted."
